#Secondary Weapons
; A player-usable siege variant of the retail Unknown Megabomb. Retains its
; damage, cargo, speed and lock time; all art and sounds are retail assets.
; Its damage types put it under the same Command Hull siege-torpedo reduction as
; every other retail bomb (see fs2rts-torpedoes-wep.tbm).
$Name: RTS Shivan Torpedo
$Model File: Harbinger.pof
$Mass: 35.0
$Velocity: 50.0
$Fire Wait: 30.0
$Damage: 3200
$Damage Type: RTS Siege Torpedo
$Shockwave damage type: RTS Siege Torpedo
$Blast Force: 2000.0
$Inner Radius: 100.0
$Outer Radius: 450.0
$Shockwave Speed: 75.0
$Armor Factor: 1.0
$Shield Factor: 0.2
$Subsystem Factor: 1.0
$Lifetime: 30.0
$Energy Consumed: 0.0
$Cargo Size: 40.0
$Homing: YES
    +Type: ASPECT
    +Turn Time: 1.5
    +Min Lock Time: 12.0
    +Lock Pixels/Sec: 25
    +Catch-up Pixels/Sec: 50
    +Catch-up Penalty: 15
$LaunchSnd: 97
$ImpactSnd: 101
$FlyBySnd: -1
$Rearm Rate: 0.02
$Flags: ( "Bomb" "Huge" "No Dumbfire" "player allowed" )
$Trail:
    +Start Width: 0.5
    +End Width: 2.0
    +Start Alpha: 1.0
    +End Alpha: 0.0
    +Max Life: 2.0
    +Bitmap: MissileTrail02
$Icon: iconmissile10
$Anim: LoadMissile10
$Impact Explosion: none
#End
